  "question": {
    "text": "The energy of gamma $(\\gamma)$ ray photon is $E$, and that of an X-ray photon is $E_{X}$. If the visible light photon has an energy of $E_{v}$, then we can say that",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
