  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$E_{y} \\geq 100 \\mathrm{keV}$<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />E_{X} &=100 \\mathrm{eV} \\text { to } 100 \\mathrm{keV} \\\\<br />E_{v} &=2.48 \\mathrm{eV}<br />\\end{aligned}$<br />So, we can say that<br />$E_{y}>E_{X}>E_{v}$",
